# New Project Checklist

EVERY TIME a new project is created in `apps/` or `packages/`, you MUST:

## 1. Add to Portfolio (REQUIRED)

Edit `apps/portfolio/data/projects.ts` and add the new project to the `projects` array:

```typescript
{
  title: "Project Name",
  description: "Short description of what it does",
  tech: "Tech1, Tech2, Tech3",
  link: "https://deployed-url.vercel.app",  // or null if not deployed
  status: "live",  // or "in-progress" or "coming-soon"
  featured: true,
  repo: "https://github.com/adszapiro/szap-projects",
  icon: "🚀"  // Use appropriate emoji
}
```

## 2. Deploy to Vercel

```bash
cd apps/NEW_PROJECT_NAME
vercel --prod --yes
```

## 3. Update Portfolio URL

After deployment, update the `link` field in `projects.ts` with the actual Vercel URL.

## 4. Redeploy Portfolio

```bash
cd apps/portfolio
vercel --prod --yes
```

## 5. Commit and Push

```bash
git add -A
git commit -m "Add NEW_PROJECT_NAME to portfolio"
git push
```

## NEVER forget these steps!
